{
  "slug": "negatives",
  "title": "Negatives",
  "titleRu": "Отрицание",
  "estMinutes": 4,
  "ruleCard": {
    "rows": [
      { "label": "I", "form": "am not / I'm not", "ruleId": "tb-negative" },
      { "label": "he / she / it", "form": "isn't", "ruleId": "tb-negative" },
      { "label": "you / we / they", "form": "aren't", "ruleId": "tb-negative" }
    ],
    "note": "**not** стоит после **be**. **don't / doesn't** сюда не ставятся."
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explanation",
      "md": "Отрицание у **be** — это **not** сразу после формы. Не **don't** и не **doesn't**: они для обычного глагола."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "Формы"
    },
    {
      "type": "explanation",
      "md": "**I am not** (или **I'm not**). **he / she / it** берут **isn't** (или **is not**). **you / we / they** берут **aren't** (или **are not**).\n\nПолные формы значат то же самое. В разговоре почти всегда I'm not, isn't, aren't."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": ["Кто", "Отрицание"],
      "rows": [
        ["I", "am not / I'm not"],
        ["he / she / it", "isn't / is not"],
        ["you / we / they", "aren't / are not"]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "en": "I'm not a teacher.",
      "ru": "Я не учитель."
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "en": "She isn't tired.",
      "ru": "Она не устала."
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "en": "They aren't at home.",
      "ru": "Их нет дома."
    },
    {
      "type": "pitfall",
      "ruleId": "tb-negative",
      "md": "Порядок такой: **be + not**. Не `She not is tired` и не `She doesn't is tired`.\n\n**don't / doesn't** уже заняты Present Simple. Здесь **isn't / aren't**."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "Коротко"
    },
    {
      "type": "recap",
      "items": [
        { "k": "I", "v": "`am not` / `I'm not`" },
        { "k": "he / she / it", "v": "`isn't`" },
        { "k": "you / we / they", "v": "`aren't`" }
      ]
    },
